  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Applying LMVT in <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> for <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> we get,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>c</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>c</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></math> as <math><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p>"
